blockchain notarization in real-time.\")\n                    .intent(\"HOW_TO_VERIFY\")\n                    .status(\"INFO\")\n                    .timestamp(now)\n                    .build();\n        }\n\n        if (msg.contains(\"blockchain\") || msg.contains(\"ledger\") || msg.contains(\"block\")) {\n            return AiChatResponse.builder()\n                    .reply(\"⛓️ **Blockchain Security Explained**:\\n\\n\"\n                            + \"Every qualification event (issuance or revocation) is cryptographically sealed into a block containing a timestamp, previous block hash, and SHA-256 payload digest. This creates an immutable chain that prevents retroactive tampering or unauthorized diploma forging.\")\n                    .intent(\"EXPLAIN_BLOCKCHAIN\")\n                    .status(\"INFO\")\n                    .timestamp(now)\n                    .build();\n        }\n\n        if (msg.contains(\"ai\") || msg.contains(\"fraud\") || msg.contains(\"anomaly\")) {\n            return AiChatResponse.builder()\n                    .reply(\"🤖 **Agentic AI Fraud Shield**:\\n\\n\"\n                            + \"Our AI engine analyzes 6 distinct heuristic vectors: cryptographic signature math, chronological date feasibility, institutional accreditation records, credential entropy, velocity anomaly tracking, and degree semantic alignment.\")\n                    .intent(\"EXPLAIN_AI\")\n                    .status(\"INFO\")\n                    .timestamp(now)\n                    .build();\n        }\n\n        // Generic intelligent fallback\n        return AiChatResponse.builder()\n                .reply(\"Hello! I am your **QVS Agentic AI Assistant**. You can ask me to:\\n\\n\"\n                        + \"• Check specific certificates (e.g., *'Check Sarah Jenkins'* or *'Verify QVS-2024-BSC-8891'*)\\n\"\n                        + \"• Explain how the **Blockchain Ledger** ensures zero tampering\\n\"\n                        + \"• Inspect **AI Fraud 